+This module belonged to the duplicate ambient development that depended on
+unsupported scalar-generic functional calculus, provisional concrete ideal
+classes, or the abandoned contour continuation facade.  The corresponding
+paper-facing results are provided by the production and vendored-Spectra route
+re-exported by `DavisKahan.Experimental.InfiniteDimensional.All`.
